            "review_title": "Review at Teppanyaki Hajime Restaurant",
            "review_text": "YSKing\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam269 contributions\n0\n落ち着く雰囲気の鉄板焼き屋さん\nApr 2019 • Friends\n鉄板カウンターのある店内はとても落ち着く雰囲気です。\n2階にはテーブル席もありました。\nお好み焼きと焼きそばはどちらも味がしっかりしていておススメです！\nデリバリーもやっているようなので、今度試してみようと思います。\n\nThere is a very calm atmosphere in the store with the iron plate counter.\nThere was also a table on the second floor.\nBoth okonomiyaki and yakisoba have good taste and are recommended!\nAs delivery seems to be done, I will try next time.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
